# ATS Update — 2026-09-18 The ladder was never climbed

Branch `rl-core-fixes`, commits `dade080` → `af3eb46`.

Root finding: **the GUI was running a policy that had never passed a single
rung, while the menu reported two rungs passed from a different file.** The
uniform-action behaviour was not a broken learner. It was an agent dropped
three rooms above anything it had been taught, which is what an agent looks
like when it has no idea where it is.

Everything else in this entry follows from that, including why the fix made
the nursery learnable in 62 episodes after 550 episodes of nothing.

