## 8. Room sizes (`7254b00`)

`default_ladder(max_grid=13)` → `12`. Growth is in steps of 2, so:

```
nursery     5x5
corridors   5x5
corridors7  7x7
avoid       7x7
hazards     7x7
foraging    7x7
primary     9x9  -> 11x11
junior      9x9  -> 11x11
```

5 stays the floor deliberately: a 3x3 or 4x4 room is solved by random
walking, so it teaches nothing that carries to the next rung. A rung has to
be hard enough that random behaviour mostly fails, and easy enough that it
sometimes succeeds — no success means no gradient.

